Package: gl-tailscale-cert
Version: {{VERSION}}
Architecture: all
Maintainer: SPDL91 and contributors <https://github.com/SPDL91/gl-tailscale-cert>
Section: net
Priority: optional
License: GPL-3.0-only
Depends: jsonfilter, uci, openssl-util, ca-bundle
Homepage: https://github.com/SPDL91/gl-tailscale-cert
Description: Opt-in Tailscale HTTPS certificates for GL.iNet web interfaces
 Discovers the device ts.net name, obtains and validates its Tailscale
 certificate, installs it for GL.iNet nginx and LuCI uHTTPd with rollback,
 repairs it after boot, LAN settings changes, or sysupgrade, and adds an
 independent GL WebUI panel.
